            "heading": "Set Description",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<p>The RX <strong>Obsidian Prescription Mask for Nearsighted Adventurers</strong> is designed for divers seeking enhanced underwater clarity. </p><p>Featuring twin tempered glass corrective lenses tailored to nearsighted vision, this sleek black mask ensures both style and functionality. </p><p>The soft silicone skirt offers a secure, comfortable fit for medium face shapes, while the broad peripheral view keeps the underwater world fully in sight. </p><p>With easy-release buckles and a soft nose pocket for effortless equalizing, it's perfect for both casual snorkeling and deep scuba dives.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Travel Snorkel Fins </strong></span></p><p>Compact and perfect! Travel Snorkel Fins offer powerful, versatile movement for any underwater adventure. </p><p>Use them for <strong>straight-leg kicks from the hip</strong> when you need speed and <strong>flutter kicks from the knee</strong> for steady, controlled propulsion. When you’re ready to relax, these fins make <strong>frog kicks</strong> easy and comfortable, reducing strain on your leg muscles.</p><p>With <strong>reinforced sidewalls</strong> for enhanced control and durable silicone for flexibility, Shorty Snorkel Fins let you master precise movements and adapt to any diving style. </p><p>Plus, you’ll get our <strong>Oceans Optics exclusive snorkeling guide</strong> with tips for unlocking new techniques and making the most of every kick.</p><p></p><p>This set includes:</p><p>1x Rx Obsidian with lenses of your choice.</p><p>1x Travel Fins</p><p>1x Snorkel - Either Classic or Dry Top (your choioce)</p><p>1x Rx Obsidian Mask Case</p><p></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
