            "content": "<ul><li>Corrective lenses built for nearsighted vision (available up to -9.0)</li><li>Leak-proof comfort with hypoallergenic soft silicone</li><li>Double-seal skirt fits securely on medium face shapes</li><li>Wide viewing field to stay aware of your surroundings</li><li>Durable materials for both snorkeling and diving</li><li>Simple, low-profile buckle system for easy adjustments</li><li>Soft nose pocket for quick equalizing</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
