    "multicolumn_39KnCE": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_prUx3b": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/3_abdc8d08-19a2-4d65-bac0-d31656eb654c.png",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Joe, Arizona",
            "text": "<h5>\"Fantastic! The last time I went snorkeling (more than 10 years ago) I wore contacts. At age 65, glasses only. I thought I was done snorkeling, until I found these! They worked perfectly! | could see the fish. And at around 80 bucks for the mask and a breather tube, it's a bargain.</h5><h5>They charge like $25 to rent them at the beaches when you go on a cruise (and it is gross using something that was in someone else's mouth!) I highly recommend these if you are near-sighted and want to snorkel.\"</h5>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_cPdXqc": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image0.jpg",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Allison R, Florida",
            "text": "<h4>Prescription goggles</h4><h4>We ordered a pair of prescription goggles for our trip to Hawaii and couldn't be more please with our purchase. </h4><h4>Shipping was quick and they worked great!<br/><br/></h4>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_MwPAPa": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2_8ed22c41-6f3b-46a9-86b5-715e7e49a39a.png",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Sage, Utah",
            "text": "<h5>\"I got the obsidian, my sister got the lumix, we also decided on matching snorkels, and they looked so cute together. We went snorkeling in mexico, and this time was so much less scary since not everything was blurry.</h5><h5>There were also some really cool tips in the snorkeling guide, we found the part about buddy safety and communication especially useful.\"</h5>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
